  "sourceTitle": "Jamie Boudreau's Cognac Cocktail",
  "sourceText": "Jamie Boudreau's Cognac Cocktail\nBy: Melissa Peterman\nPublished: Tuesday, January 19, 2010 - 8:17pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 1/2 ounces cognac\n3/4 ounce punt e mes\n1/4 ounce maraschino\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Combine all ingredients using chilled bar ware. 2 Strain. 3 Serve up with a lemon twist.\n\nAbout\n\n\n**Note, this recipe was created by Jamie Boudreau during \"Drinking Lessons,\" a Nightschool event at the Sorrento Hotel in Seattle, WA on January 18th 2010.",
